{"4956450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lanelord", "steam_appid": 4956450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanelord is a chaotic, fast‑paced multiplayer game where the road comes alive — and one of you controls it.</strong> In this unique 2‑player (4‑player planned) experience, a rolling, shifting lane winds through a procedurally generated world while a second player drives an agile little car on its back. Whether you work together or try to sabotage each other depends entirely on the game mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Roles. Two Goals. Endless Chaos.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Player:</strong> Shape, twist and tilt the lane in real time. Create smooth paths… or deadly traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car Player:</strong> Stay on the road, react fast, and survive whatever madness the road throws at you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different thanks to procedural generation, unpredictable terrain, and dynamic item drops that can help you survive — or help you ruin someone else’s day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co‑op Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up as Road and Car to travel as far as possible. Communicate, synchronize, and master the rhythm of movement to push your shared high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras/6215d31e427aeada58be790c13d35e13.avif?t=1785420504\" alt=\"4\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras_big/6215d31e427aeada58be790c13d35e13.webp?t=1785420504 width=1560 height=825 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Versus Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure chaos. The Road tries to throw the Car off its back, while the Car fights to stay on. Use items, tricks, and timing to outplay your opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ranked Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ladder in competitive 1v1 matches. Play as Road or Car and face off against other players through matchmaking. Precision, prediction, and mind games decide the winner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends through the Steam friends list or join public lobbies via the built‑in lobby browser. Quick to learn, hard to master — perfect for short sessions or long competitive grinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras/714cca4f0c5bd5dfcbf50a7296e100fa.avif?t=1785420504\" alt=\"3\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras_big/714cca4f0c5bd5dfcbf50a7296e100fa.webp?t=1785420504 width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative asymmetric gameplay: <strong>One player is the Road, one is the Car</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds for infinite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items that change the flow of every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co‑op, Versus, and Ranked modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online play via Steam friends list &amp; lobby browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future update: <strong>4‑player chaos; Cool Customizations for Car and Road; Player Level Progression</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lanelord is a chaotic, fast‑paced multiplayer game where the road comes alive — and one of you controls it.</strong> In this unique 2‑player (4‑player planned) e