mind games decide the winner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends through the Steam friends list or join public lobbies via the built‑in lobby browser. Quick to learn, hard to master — perfect for short sessions or long competitive grinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras/714cca4f0c5bd5dfcbf50a7296e100fa.avif?t=1785420504\" alt=\"3\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/extras_big/714cca4f0c5bd5dfcbf50a7296e100fa.webp?t=1785420504 width=1560 height=827 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative asymmetric gameplay: <strong>One player is the Road, one is the Car</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated worlds for infinite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items that change the flow of every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co‑op, Versus, and Ranked modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online play via Steam friends list &amp; lobby browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future update: <strong>4‑player chaos; Cool Customizations for Car and Road; Player Level Progression</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Lanelord is a fast-paced asymmetric multiplayer game where one player controls a rolling, shifting road and the other drives a car on top of it. Race through a procedurally generated world, survive chaotic terrain, and use items to gain the upper hand.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/bac5565457ae1e870b075f4deaf8bef07b08d240/header.jpg?t=1785420504", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4956450/41cf8653a